; =============
;    DJ-VAN
; =============
;  "Mario Mayhem"
;  Version :   3.73
; 
;  -Credits: 
;  Sprite work and code by DJ-VAN
;  - Website > http://www.Mugen-Infantry.net/
;
;  Sprites ripped by Randy Solem
;  - Website > http://www.videogamedc.com/
;
;
;	-Info:
;	Inspired from the back of my sick mind XD. The original sprites were done by Randy
; 	Solem for a really funny flash movie called Rise of the Mushroom Kingdom. The 
;	music in this stage is crazy. The concept of this stage is crazy. Everything about this 
;	stage is crazy. And no, I didn’t make this stage because I wanted a mature Mario game
;	=P. I’m not that big of a Nintendo fan either (Sega FTW). I just made it to make it. Also
;	the music was made especially for this stage so enjoy. DJ-VAN does it again, this stage
;	= instant classic…
;	
;	-Props:
;	Special thanks to Aztec Soldier and the rest of the MI staff for holding it 
;	down. Mugen-Infantry… WE OUTFLANK YOUR SQUAD!
;
;--------------------------------------------------------
